# --- Jupyter ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notebook outputs ARE versioned: the interpretation cells quote the numbers the
# code cells produce, and without them the text loses its support.  What is
# ignored is the scaffolding Jupyter regenerates every session.
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/

